# --- Obsidian vault (proxybuying-obsidian/) -------------------------------
# Track ONLY AI-Context/ (roadmap, soul, identity, references, …). Ignore
# Obsidian config and private user notes. Placed last so it overrides the
# generic `references/` rule above.
/proxybuying-obsidian/.obsidian/
/proxybuying-obsidian/USERS NOTES/
# AI-Context/references holds source PDFs; override the generic `references/` rule.
!/proxybuying-obsidian/AI-Context/references/
# …but PleaseIgnore/ under it is personal/scratch — keep it out of git.
/proxybuying-obsidian/AI-Context/references/PleaseIgnore/
